# Simulated downward rangefinder (SITL only). On the real drone, configure the real one instead
# (e.g. a TFmini-S class lidar: RNGFND1_TYPE 20, on a serial port) with the same range limits.
# Precision landing needs it for PLND_ALT_MIN / PLND_ALT_MAX.
RNGFND1_TYPE     100
RNGFND1_MIN      0.2
RNGFND1_MAX      12
RNGFND1_ORIENT   25
